page 730 (
    name: Sales Lifecycle Control Tower
    alias: SALES-LIFECYCLE-CONTROL-TOWER
    title: Sales Lifecycle Control Tower
    appearance {
        pageTemplate: @/standard
        templateOptions: #DEFAULT#
    }
    navigation {
        cursorFocus: doNotFocusCursor
        warnOnUnsavedChanges: false
    }
    security {
        formAutoComplete: false
    }
    advanced {
        reloadOnSubmit: always
    }
    help {
        helpText:
            ```html
            SALES LIFECYCLE CONTROL TOWER (SLC) — data contract (HSPL).
            
            LIFECYCLE (data-validated 22-08-2026, see docs/slc-dashboard-investigation.md):
              SALESCONFIRM -> SALESORDER(.SalesConfirmTNo) -> DESPATCHADVICE(.SalesOrderTNo)
              -> MATERIALOUT(.ReferenceTNo=DespatchAdvice; GateInTime/GateOutTime = Gate In/Out)
              -> WEIGHMENT(FirstWeight/SecondWeight = Weighment/Final; Gross/Tare/Net)
              -> CCINVOICE(.SalesOrderTNo,.DespatchAdviceTNo) -> EINVOICE(.CCInvoiceTNo; IRN/ACK/EWB).
            Gate In+Out are ONE MaterialOut row; Weighment+Final are ONE Weighment row (two weighings).
            
            VALUE GRAIN. Funnel/KPI value = SUM(detail.Amount) (taxable line value) at each stage
            that has value (Confirmation, Sales Order, Invoice), so the value funnel is one grain and
            the Invoice figure reconciles to the CC Invoice (Sales) Register (page 56). Dispatch/Gate/
            Weighment/E-Invoice have no rupee value in the ERP -> count/quantity only.
            
            CATEGORY. Master = ItemSpecification.ItemCategoryCode -> ItemCategory. Override exists ONLY
            at SalesConfirmDetail.ItemCategoryCode; SO/Invoice inherit from the specification master.
            Reporting uses the spec-master category; a confirm-time override is a data-quality flag.
            
            BILL RECEIPT / COLLECTION. No sales bill-receipt document exists (RECEIPT vouchers are FREIGHT).
            Customer collection/outstanding reuses the AR model (pages 690-702). Profitability is
            UNAVAILABLE (no cost on sales lines) and is labelled so, never fabricated.
            
            PANEL SECURITY. Every region repeats the scalar-subquery guard
              ((Select GetUserPanelAB_apex() From dual) Is Null Or a.Panel = (Select ...)).
            READ-ONLY. Every region is a SELECT. No INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE.
            ```
    }

    region agent-performance (
        name: Agent Performance
        type: interactiveReport
        source {
            location: localDatabase
            type: sqlQuery
            sqlQuery:
                ```sql
                Select Nvl(GetPartyName(ci.AgentCode),'(direct / no agent)') AGENT,
                       Round(Sum(d.Amount)/1e7,2) INV_CR,
                       Round(Sum(d.Quantity1)) QTY,
                       Count(Distinct ci.TNo) INVOICES,
                       Count(Distinct ci.PartyCode) CUSTOMERS
                  From CCInvoice ci Join CCInvoiceDetail d On d.TNo=ci.TNo
                 Where ci.CCInvoiceDate Between to_date(:P730_FROMDATE,'DD-MM-RRRR') And to_date(:P730_TODATE,'DD-MM-RRRR')
                   And ((Select GetUserPanelAB_apex() From dual) Is Null Or ci.Panel=(Select GetUserPanelAB_apex() From dual))
                   And (:P730_COMPANY Is Null Or ci.CompanyCode=:P730_COMPANY)
                   And (:P730_LOCATION Is Null Or ci.LocationCode=:P730_LOCATION)
                   And (:P730_PANEL Is Null Or ci.Panel=:P730_PANEL)
                 Group By ci.AgentCode
                 Order By Sum(d.Amount) Desc
                ```
            pageItemsToSubmit: [
                P730_FROMDATE
                P730_TODATE
                P730_COMPANY
                P730_LOCATION
                P730_PANEL
            ]
        }
        layout {
            sequence: 64
            slot: body
            column: 1
            columnSpan: 12
        }
        appearance {
            template: @/standard
            templateOptions: [
                #DEFAULT#
                t-Region--scrollBody
            ]
            cssClasses: ds-register
        }
        advanced {
            htmlDomId: p730Agents
        }
        pagination {
            type: rowRangesXToYOfZ
        }
        performance {
            lazyLoading: true
        }
        messages {
            whenNoDataFound: No sales in this scope.
        }
        advanced {
            savedReportMappingIdentifier: 47729986509379086
        }

